A Markdown file with a code fence that never closes, as while typing one: CommonMark runs the
fence to the end of the file, so the `## Usage` line after it is code, not a heading, and the
open sections run to the last line.
== args
input/broken.md
== file input/broken.md
# Guide

## Install

```sh
npm install

## Usage

Text.
== stdout
input/broken.md (10 lines)
[L1-L10] # Guide
[L3-L10] ## Install
== stderr
== exit 0
